        subgraph PRD["prod — planned, ephemeral by default"]
            PR["same real-AWS shape as staging<br/>demo-sized<br/>RDS / ElastiCache / MSK<br/>SSM Parameter Store<br/>fuller observability"]
        end
    end

    REL -.->|"automated gates:<br/>tests + schemaRegistryCheck"| D
    L -.->|"same bare-manifest shape"| D
    D -.->|"gated stand-up"| S
    S -.->|"gated stand-up"| PR

    NOTE["Only local is populated today.<br/>dev/staging/prod are ADR 0016 designs: dev stays bare-manifest with no managed AWS;<br/>staging is the first real-AWS tier, stood up for a validation window;<br/>prod mirrors staging, demo-sized and ephemeral by default.<br/>Secrets: SSM Parameter Store. Backstage/Dependency-Track are org-wide, not per-tier."]

